      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Cooking turkey in USA is mapped to a festive roasted turkey",
      "description": "The text 'how to cook turkey in usa' is directly mapped onto the visual of the roasted turkey, implying that the visual representation of the festive, appetizing turkey is the method or result of cooking turkey in the USA. This is a direct analogical mapping where the text labels the visual material as the 'how to' for the activity mentioned.",
